{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.evalSuggestions\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">evalSuggestions</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Tactic\">Elab.Tactic.Tactic</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.evalSuggestions","kind":"def","line":546,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.evalSuggestions","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L546-L559"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.elabSetLibrarySuggestions\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabSetLibrarySuggestions</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab\">Elab.Command.CommandElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Specify a library suggestion engine.\nNote that Lean does not ship a default library suggestion engine,\nso this is only useful in conjunction with a downstream package which provides one.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.elabSetLibrarySuggestions","kind":"def","line":534,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.elabSetLibrarySuggestions","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L534-L543"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.select\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">select</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\">Config</a> := <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.mk\">{</a> <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.mk\">}</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion\">Suggestion</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Generate library suggestions for the given metavariable, using the currently registered library suggestions engine. ","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.select","kind":"def","line":515,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.select","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L515-L521"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.getSelector\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">getSelector</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.getSelector","kind":"opaque","line":512,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.getSelector","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L512-L513"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">unsafe def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.getSelectorImpl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">getSelectorImpl</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Get the currently registered library suggestions selector by looking up the stored declaration name.\nReturns `none` if no selector is registered or if evaluation fails.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.getSelectorImpl","kind":"def","line":501,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.getSelectorImpl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L501-L510"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.librarySuggestionsAttr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">librarySuggestionsAttr</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Attributes.html#Lean.TagAttribute\">TagAttribute</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Attribute for registering library suggestions selectors. ","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.librarySuggestionsAttr","kind":"opaque","line":493,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.librarySuggestionsAttr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L493-L499"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.librarySuggestionsExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">librarySuggestionsExt</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/EnvExtension.html#Lean.SimplePersistentEnvExtension\">SimplePersistentEnvExtension</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.librarySuggestionsExt","kind":"opaque","line":484,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.librarySuggestionsExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L484-L491"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.currentFile\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">currentFile</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A library suggestion engine that returns locally defined theorems (those in the current file). ","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.currentFile","kind":"def","line":468,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.currentFile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L468-L482"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.random\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">random</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">gen</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Random.html#StdGen\">StdGen</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Data/Random.html#StdGen.mk\">{</a> <span class=\"fn\">s1</span> := <span class=\"fn\">37</span>, <span class=\"fn\">s2</span> := <span class=\"fn\">59</span> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Random.html#StdGen.mk\">}</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A random premise selection algorithm, provided solely for testing purposes. ","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.random","kind":"def","line":454,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.random","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L454-L466"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.empty\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">empty</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The trivial premise selector, which returns no suggestions.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.empty","kind":"def","line":449,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.empty","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L449-L452"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.isDeniedPremise\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">isDeniedPremise</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">name</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">allowPrivate</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.false\">false</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.isDeniedPremise","kind":"def","line":431,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.isDeniedPremise","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L431-L445"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.isDeniedModule\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">isDeniedModule</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">env</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Environment.html#Lean.Environment\">Environment</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">moduleName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.isDeniedModule","kind":"def","line":428,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.isDeniedModule","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L428-L429"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.typePrefixDenyListExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">typePrefixDenyListExt</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/EnvExtension.html#Lean.SimplePersistentEnvExtension\">SimplePersistentEnvExtension</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A premise whose `type.getForallBody.getAppFn` is a constant that has one of these prefixes is not retrieved.\n\nUse `run_cmd modifyEnv fun env => typePrefixDenyListExt.addEntry env typePrefix` to add a type prefix to the deny list.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.typePrefixDenyListExt","kind":"opaque","line":417,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.typePrefixDenyListExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L417-L426"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.nameDenyListExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">nameDenyListExt</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/EnvExtension.html#Lean.SimplePersistentEnvExtension\">SimplePersistentEnvExtension</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A premise whose name has one of the following components is not retrieved.\n\nUse `run_cmd modifyEnv fun env => nameDenyListExt.addEntry env name` to add a name to the deny list.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.nameDenyListExt","kind":"opaque","line":406,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.nameDenyListExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L406-L415"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.moduleDenyListExt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">moduleDenyListExt</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/EnvExtension.html#Lean.SimplePersistentEnvExtension\">SimplePersistentEnvExtension</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Premises from a module whose name has one of the following components are not retrieved.\n\nUse `run_cmd modifyEnv fun env => moduleDenyListExt.addEntry env module` to add a module to the deny list.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.moduleDenyListExt","kind":"opaque","line":395,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.moduleDenyListExt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L395-L404"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.intersperse\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Selector</span>.<span class=\"name\">intersperse</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">selector₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">selector₂</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ratio</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a> := <span class=\"fn\">0.5</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Combine two premise selectors by interspersing their results (ignoring scores).\nThe parameter `ratio` (defaulting to 0.5) controls the fraction of suggestions drawn from\n`selector₁` while results are available from both. It is clamped to `[0, 1]`, and ties are\nresolved in favour of `selector₁`.\n\nBoth selectors are asked for the full `maxSuggestions`, rather than a `ratio`-split share, so that\nif one selector returns fewer than its share the other can compensate. This doubles the retrieval\nwork compared to splitting the budget.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.intersperse","kind":"def","line":339,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.intersperse","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L339-L389"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.filterGrindAnnotated\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Selector</span>.<span class=\"name\">filterGrindAnnotated</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">selector</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Filter out theorems from grind-annotated modules when the caller is \"grind\".\nModules marked with `grind_annotated` contain manually reviewed/annotated theorems,\nso they should be excluded from automatic premise selection for grind.\nOther callers (like \"simp\") still receive suggestions from these modules.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.filterGrindAnnotated","kind":"def","line":320,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.filterGrindAnnotated","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L320-L337"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.combine\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Selector</span>.<span class=\"name\">combine</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">selector₁ </span><span class=\"fn\">selector₂</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Combine two premise selectors, returning the best suggestions. ","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.combine","kind":"def","line":302,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.combine","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L302-L318"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.maxSuggestions\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Selector</span>.<span class=\"name\">maxSuggestions</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">selector</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Wrapper for `Selector` that ensures\nthe `maxSuggestions` field in `Config` is respected, post-hoc.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.maxSuggestions","kind":"def","line":294,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.maxSuggestions","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L294-L300"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.postFilter\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Selector</span>.<span class=\"name\">postFilter</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">selector</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\">Selector</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Respect the `Config.filter` option by implementing it as a post-filter.\nIf a premise selection implementation does not natively handle the filter,\nit should be wrapped with this function.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.postFilter","kind":"def","line":285,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector.postFilter","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L285-L292"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.ppSelector\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">ppSelector</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">selector</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\">Config</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion\">Suggestion</a>)</span></span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion\">Suggestion</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Construct a `Selector` (which acts on an `MVarId`)\nfrom a function which takes the pretty printed goal.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.ppSelector","kind":"def","line":275,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.ppSelector","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L275-L281"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Selector</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector","kind":"def","line":273,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Selector","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L273-L273"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.hint\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">hint</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"An optional arbitrary \"hint\" to the premise selection algorithm.\nThere is no guarantee that the algorithm will make any use of the hint.\n\nPotential use cases include a natural language comment provided by the user\n(e.g. allowing use of the premise selector as a search engine)\nor including context from the current proof and/or file.\n\nWe may later split these use cases into separate fields if necessary.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.hint","kind":"def","line":271,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.hint","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L271-L271"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.filter\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">filter</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A filter on suggestions; only suggestions returning `true` should be returned.\n(It can be better to filter on the premise selection side, to ensure that enough suggestions are returned.)\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.filter","kind":"def","line":260,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.filter","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L260-L260"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.caller\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">caller</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The tactic that is calling the premise selection, e.g. `simp`, `grind`, or `aesop`.\nThis may be used to adjust the score of the suggestions\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.caller","kind":"def","line":255,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.caller","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L255-L255"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.maxSuggestions\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">maxSuggestions</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The maximum number of suggestions to return.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.maxSuggestions","kind":"def","line":250,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.maxSuggestions","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L250-L250"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">Lean.MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span>)</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span> → <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\">Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config</a></span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.mk","kind":"ctor","line":246,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L246-L271"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config","kind":"structure","line":246,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Config","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L246-L271"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.flag\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Suggestion</span>.<span class=\"name\">flag</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion\">Suggestion</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Optional flag associated with the suggestion, e.g. \"←\" or \"=\",\nif the premise selection algorithm is aware of the tactic consuming the results,\nand wants to suggest modifiers for this suggestion.\nE.g. this supports calling `simp` in the reverse direction,\nor telling `grind` or `aesop` to use the theorem in a particular way.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.flag","kind":"def","line":244,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.flag","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L244-L244"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.score\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Suggestion</span>.<span class=\"name\">score</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion\">Suggestion</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The score of the suggestion, as a probability that this suggestion should be used.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.score","kind":"def","line":236,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.score","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L236-L236"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.name\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Suggestion</span>.<span class=\"name\">name</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion\">Suggestion</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.name","kind":"def","line":232,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.name","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L232-L232"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Suggestion</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span> → <a href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion\">Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion</a></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.mk","kind":"ctor","line":225,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L225-L244"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">LibrarySuggestions</span>.<span class=\"name\">Suggestion</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A `Suggestion` is essentially just an identifier and a confidence score that the identifier is relevant.\nIf the premise selection request included information about the intended use (e.g. in the simplifier, in `grind`, etc.)\nthe score may be adjusted for that application.\n\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion","kind":"structure","line":225,"name":"Lean.LibrarySuggestions.Suggestion","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L225-L244"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.MVarId.getRelevantConstants\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">MVarId</span>.<span class=\"name\">getRelevantConstants</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameSet\">NameSet</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.MVarId.getRelevantConstants","kind":"def","line":210,"name":"Lean.MVarId.getRelevantConstants","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L210-L219"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.MVarId.getConstants\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">MVarId</span>.<span class=\"name\">getConstants</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.MVarId\">MVarId</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameSet\">NameSet</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.MVarId.getConstants","kind":"def","line":198,"name":"Lean.MVarId.getConstants","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L198-L207"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.Expr.relevantConstantsOfEach\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Expr</span>.<span class=\"name\">relevantConstantsOfEach</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">es</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cancelTk?</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/System/CancelToken.html#IO.CancelToken\">IO.CancelToken</a></span> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option.none\">none</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`relevantConstants` of each expression in `es`. It computes the parameter kinds of each head\nconstant once for all of `es`, so it is faster than `relevantConstants` on each expression. An\nexpression whose traversal fails gets `#[]`; interrupts and resource limits still propagate. When\n`cancelTk?` is set, this throws an interrupt exception within the next 64 expressions.\n","docLink":"./Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.html#Lean.Expr.relevantConstantsOfEach","kind":"opaque","line":184,"name":"Lean.Expr.relevantConstantsOfEach","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c29b6dda4f7c20e3eeaa717c4e565663c5cfa364/src/Lean/LibrarySuggestions/Basic.lean#L184-L193"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kin